    - Added CommandRegistry class to manage command registration and dispatching.
    - Introduced HelpCommand to display available commands grouped by category.
    - Created StatusCommand to show the runner's current status.
    - Developed UnknownCommand to handle unrecognized inputs gracefully.
    - Implemented GameModel class to manage game state, including player attributes and inventory.
    - Added Console class for user interaction, handling command input and output.
    - Created unit tests for CommandRegistry and GameModel to ensure functionality and correctness.
    - Removed legacy GameModel implementation and replaced it with the new structure.
    
