[32m+[m[32m# The HTML_COLORSTYLE tag can be used to specify if the generated HTML output[m
[32m+[m[32m# should be rendered with a dark or light theme.[m
[32m+[m[32m# Possible values are: LIGHT always generate light mode output, DARK always[m
[32m+[m[32m# generate dark mode output, AUTO_LIGHT automatically set the mode according to[m
[32m+[m[32m# the user preference, use light mode if no preference is set (the default),[m
[32m+[m[32m# AUTO_DARK automatically set the mode according to the user preference, use[m
[32m+[m[32m# dark mode if no preference is set and TOGGLE allow to user to switch between[m
[32m+[m[32m# light and dark mode via a button.[m
[32m+[m[32m# The default value is: AUTO_LIGHT.[m
