[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m# The HTML_COLORSTYLE_HUE tag controls the color of the HTML output. Doxygen[m
[32m+[m[32m# will adjust the colors in the style sheet and background images according to[m
[32m+[m[32m# this color. Hue is specified as an angle on a color-wheel, see[m
[32m+[m[32m# https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hue for more information. For instance the value[m
[32m+[m[32m# 0 represents red, 60 is yellow, 120 is green, 180 is cyan, 240 is blue, 300[m
[32m+[m[32m# purple, and 360 is red again.[m
[32m+[m[32m# Minimum value: 0, maximum value: 359, default value: 220.[m
[32m+[m[32m# This tag requires that the tag GENERATE_HTML is set to YES.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mHTML_COLORSTYLE_HUE    = 220[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m# The HTML_COLORSTYLE_SAT tag controls the purity (or saturation) of the colors[m
[32m+[m[32m# in the HTML output. For a value of 0 the output will use gray-scales only. A[m
[32m+[m[32m# value of 255 will produce the most vivid colors.[m
[32m+[m[32m# Minimum value: 0, maximum value: 255, default value: 100.[m
[32m+[m[32m# This tag requires that the tag GENERATE_HTML is set to YES.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mHTML_COLORSTYLE_SAT    = 100[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m# The HTML_COLORSTYLE_GAMMA tag controls the gamma correction applied to the[m
[32m+[m[32m# luminance component of the colors in the HTML output. Values below 100[m
[32m+[m[32m# gradually make the output lighter, whereas values above 100 make the output[m
[32m+[m[32m# darker. The value divided by 100 is the actual gamma applied, so 80 represents[m
[32m+[m[32m# a gamma of 0.8, The value 220 represents a gamma of 2.2, and 100 does not[m
[32m+[m[32m# change the gamma.[m
[32m+[m[32m# Minimum value: 40, maximum value: 240, default value: 80.[m
[32m+[m[32m# This tag requires that the tag GENERATE_HTML is set to YES.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mHTML_COLORSTYLE_GAMMA  = 80[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m# If the HTML_DYNAMIC_MENUS tag is set to YES then the generated HTML[m
[32m+[m[32m# documentation will contain a main index with vertical navigation menus that[m
[32m+[m[32m# are dynamically created via JavaScript. If disabled, the navigation index will[m
[32m+[m[32m# consists of multiple levels of tabs that are statically embedded in every HTML[m
