[32m+[m[32m# and the web page is served via a secure context (see:[m
[32m+[m[32m# https://www.w3.org/TR/secure-contexts/), i.e. using the https: or file:[m
[32m+[m[32m# protocol.[m
[32m+[m[32m# The default value is: YES.[m
[32m+[m[32m# This tag requires that the tag GENERATE_HTML is set to YES.[m
