[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mHTML_PROJECT_COOKIE    =[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m# With HTML_INDEX_NUM_ENTRIES one can control the preferred number of entries[m
[32m+[m[32m# shown in the various tree structured indices initially; the user can expand[m
[32m+[m[32m# and collapse entries dynamically later on. Doxygen will expand the tree to[m
