[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m# If the GENERATE_DOCSET tag is set to YES, additional index files will be[m
[32m+[m[32m# generated that can be used as input for Apple's Xcode 3 integrated development[m
[32m+[m[32m# environment (see:[m
[32m+[m[32m# https://developer.apple.com/xcode/), introduced with OSX 10.5 (Leopard). To[m
[32m+[m[32m# create a documentation set, doxygen will generate a Makefile in the HTML[m
