[32m+[m[32m# If the GENERATE_HTMLHELP tag is set to YES then doxygen generates three[m
[32m+[m[32m# additional HTML index files: index.hhp, index.hhc, and index.hhk. The[m
[32m+[m[32m# index.hhp is a project file that can be read by Microsoft's HTML Help Workshop[m
[32m+[m[32m# on Windows. In the beginning of 2021 Microsoft took the original page, with[m
[32m+[m[32m# a.o. the download links, offline the HTML help workshop was already many years[m
[32m+[m[32m# in maintenance mode). You can download the HTML help workshop from the web[m
[32m+[m[32m# archives at Installation executable (see:[m
[32m+[m[32m# http://web.archive.org/web/20160201063255/http://download.microsoft.com/downlo[m
[32m+[m[32m# ad/0/A/9/0A939EF6-E31C-430F-A3DF-DFAE7960D564/htmlhelp.exe).[m
[32m+[m[32m#[m
[32m+[m[32m# The HTML Help Workshop contains a compiler that can convert all HTML output[m
[32m+[m[32m# generated by doxygen into a single compiled HTML file (.chm). Compiled HTML[m
[32m+[m[32m# files are now used as the Windows 98 help format, and will replace the old[m
[32m+[m[32m# Windows help format (.hlp) on all Windows platforms in the future. Compressed[m
[32m+[m[32m# HTML files also contain an index, a table of contents, and you can search for[m
[32m+[m[32m# words in the documentation. The HTML workshop also contains a viewer for[m
[32m+[m[32m# compressed HTML files.[m
[32m+[m[32m# The default value is: NO.[m
[32m+[m[32m# This tag requires that the tag GENERATE_HTML is set to YES.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mGENERATE_HTMLHELP      = NO[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m# The CHM_FILE tag can be used to specify the file name of the resulting .chm[m
