[32m+[m[32m# install this plugin and make it available under the help contents menu in[m
[32m+[m[32m# Eclipse, the contents of the directory containing the HTML and XML files needs[m
[32m+[m[32m# to be copied into the plugins directory of eclipse. The name of the directory[m
[32m+[m[32m# within the plugins directory should be the same as the ECLIPSE_DOC_ID value.[m
